\code{$} is a shortcut for the one-index form of \code{[[} / \verb{[[<-}: \code{p$name} is
equivalent to \code{p[["name"]]}, and \code{p$name <- value} to
\code{p[["name"]] <- value}. This works for meta fields, step-table columns,
